msgid ""
"The `make flamegraph` command will create a SVG of profiling data collected "
"inside of Redox, the SVG location is: `build/flamegraph/$(TARGET)-"
"$(CONFIG_NAME)-kflamegraph.svg`"
msgstr ""

#: src/performance.md:139
msgid ""
"Use the `KPROF_OPTIONS=option-value` environment variable to determine what "
"formatting options you want for your flamegraph:"
msgstr ""

#: src/performance.md:141
msgid "'i' for relaxed checking of function length"
msgstr ""

#: src/performance.md:142
msgid "'o' for reporting function plus offset rather than just function"
msgstr ""

#: src/performance.md:143
msgid "'x' for both grouping by function and with offset"
msgstr ""

#: src/performance.md:145
msgid "Replace the \"option-value\" with your preferred formatting options."
msgstr ""

